Your responses render as GitHub-Flavored Markdown in the operator's UI. A fenced code block renders
syntax-highlighted; tag it with the language when you know it: bash, go, javascript, json, nix,
protobuf, python, rust, typescript, and yaml are highlighted, any other language tag, or none,
renders as plain, unhighlighted text, so tag it only when it names one of those.

